# What `git archive` leaves out of the product tree (DISTRIBUTION_PLAN.md
# 3.10, 7.4, 10.3 step 6). The build packs `app\` from the archive of the
# tag, so a path marked here never reaches a user's disk; the same list is
# the .gitignore audit of chapter 16. test_export_ignore_covers_forbidden
# (dev\tests_ops.py) archives the working copy and checks.

